              <th scope="col">Bought back<button type="button" class="dr-tt" aria-label="About this column">?<span class="dr-tt-card">When the cash went back into bitcoin: at the buy-back level, at the deadline, or not yet (still in cash, valued at today&rsquo;s price).</span></button></th>
              <th scope="col" class="n">Tax paid<button type="button" class="dr-tt" aria-label="About this column">?<span class="dr-tt-card">Tax on the sale in a taxable account, on your stack. Zero in an IRA.</span></button></th>
              <th scope="col" class="n">Round trip<button type="button" class="dr-tt" aria-label="About this column">?<span class="dr-tt-card">Bitcoin held after buying back, as a multiple of what you held before the sale.</span></button></th>
              <th scope="col" class="n">Your stack<button type="button" class="dr-tt" aria-label="About this column">?<span class="dr-tt-card">Your stack after this cycle, carrying every earlier cycle forward.</span></button></th>
              <th scope="col" class="n">vs HODL<button type="button" class="dr-tt dr-tt-right" aria-label="About this column">?<span class="dr-tt-card">Bitcoin you hold after this cycle, minus the bitcoin you started with.</span></button></th>
              <th scope="col" class="n">Worth today<button type="button" class="dr-tt dr-tt-right" aria-label="About this column">?<span class="dr-tt-card">That difference at today&rsquo;s price. Before tax in a taxable account.</span></button></th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody id="dr2CycBody"></tbody>
          </table></div>
          <p class="dr2-small">&ldquo;Round trip&rdquo; is the bitcoin held after buying back, as a multiple of what you held before the sale. &ldquo;Your stack&rdquo; carries every earlier cycle forward, with this cycle&rsquo;s change below it. &ldquo;vs HODL&rdquo; is the bitcoin you hold after the cycle minus the bitcoin you started with, and &ldquo;Worth today&rdquo; is that difference <span id="dr2WorthNote">at today&rsquo;s price</span>, before tax in a taxable account. Prices are the site&rsquo;s ~12-day series, so a rule fires on the first sample past its level.</p>
